{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Rebind source-owned errors in steps and condition checks.** `StepOperation.handleStepFailure` and `WaitForConditionOperation.handleCheckFailure` still copy a thrown `DurableOperationException`'s `ErrorObject` directly. If user code rethrows a source-bearing operation failure, the new checkpoint contains an envelope owned by the original entity, so reading it fails ownership validation. Use `rebindForwardedError` in both paths before RETRY/FAIL and add replay tests with differing offloaders.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7okND1","finding_digest":"6ce7d5093a139ac001c38e145c80185660969182950602459b7d70e24b053df8","finding_id":"arf_v1_ntt5kcj2conmaaodrykfzaaykz","finding_key":"sdk/operation/serializabledurableoperation::deserializeexception::propagated-exception-offloader-preservation","identity_key":"sdk/operation/serializabledurableoperation::deserializeexception::propagated-exception-offloader-preservation","line":220,"observation_digest":"95c5e79a0265ddd2576602e8b55c2592def5852ebbd7ce6928483fed01b34956","observation_id":"aro_v1_sxc6pgqcmxo5ev3galulkxbfsl","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/SerializableDurableOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ntt5kcj2conmaaodrykfzaaykz","published_at":"2026-09-01T07:34:59Z","review_id":"arr_v1_bnkytan6qbz2kkbfo5ofv5teg6","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"e9f3957eec87467c5d8566ed014a6e592000f653","reviewer":"codex","start_line":219,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_2t2ffnj2xvyatsivfbxxite3rm","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T07:34:59Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
